; Fighter chip variant for Akheton SDG.
$Name: RTSF Akheton SDG ;;      the anti-subsystem weapon
+Title:                                 XSTR("GTW Akheton SDG", 3258)
+Description:
XSTR(
"Tactical Weapon
Subsystem Disruption", 3259)
$end_multi_text
+Tech Title:				    XSTR("GTW Akheton SDG", 3260)
+Tech Anim:					    Tech_Akheton_SDG
+Tech Description:
XSTR("The Vasudan-made Akheton SDG Advanced Disruptor was a direct result of the phenomenal success of GTA disruption weaponry in the Great War. The GTW-41x Advanced Disruptor subsequently underwent a retrofit and was pushed into mass production. With the exception of the Subach HL-7, more SDG units have been produced by the GTVA than any other weapon in history. The SDG is notorious for its demanding power requirements.", 3261)
$end_multi_text
