$end_multi_text
+Tech Title:				   XSTR("GTW-66 Maxim", 3284)
+Tech Anim:					   Tech_GTW-66_Maxim_Gun
+Tech Description:
XSTR(
"Reconstruction efforts after the Great War inspired advancements in metallurgy and efficient conventional explosives. The two are elegantly combined in the GTW-66 Maxim. The Maxim is by definition an energy weapon, though it behaves like a high-velocity mass-driver cannon, accelerating uranium slugs along its smoothbore barrel. The Maxim has a difficult time penetrating energy-based shields, but it has a devastating effect on hull plating and subsystem armor.", 3285)
$end_multi_text
